; Bytecode (SSB1) code in separately compiled objects (rcc -c --bytecode)
; uses the full dispatch table @vmtab (generated by build.py from
; rcc/bcops.py, fixed opcode numbers) and no program-wide scalar block or
; call table; these empty ones satisfy the VM's references to them.  A
; whole program built by rcc defines its own and never links these.
        section data
        align 2
@gs:
@ct:
